  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Thinly slice zucchini and leek into rounds.\n• Place the veggies on a lined oven tray, drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly, then roast until tender, 15-18 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66c53cdb3546b43b79d2ecd1-e63cba28.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are roasting, thinly slice tomato into wedges.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Pick and finely chop thyme leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66c53cdb3546b43b79d2ecd1-0d3719eb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add tomato paste and garlic and cook, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add the water, brown sugar and butter and stir until slightly reduced, 1-2 minutes. Season with a pinch of salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66c53cdb3546b43b79d2ecd1-5487fb67.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies are done, place flatbreads on a flat surface, rough-side down. Spread pizza sauce evenly over flatbreads and sprinkle with Cheddar cheese. Top with roasted veggies and thyme.\n• Bake the pizzas directly on an oven rack until the cheese is melted slightly and the flatbreads are crisp, 10-12 minutes. TIP: Placing the pizzas directly on the wire rack helps the flatbread crisp up.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66c53cdb3546b43b79d2ecd1-2c46bad0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the pizzas are baking, combine the vinegar and a drizzle of olive oil in a medium bowl. Season to taste.\n• Add tomato and mixed salad leaves, then toss to coat. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66c53cdb3546b43b79d2ecd1-fc92afff.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Season the pizzas, then top with rocket leaves and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Evenly slice leek and thyme mini flatbread pizzas and serve with mixed leaf salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66c53cdb3546b43b79d2ecd1-7317d103.jpeg"
    }
  ]
